msgstr "Check and repair artwork job database"

msgctxt "#32902"
msgid "The artwork job database is damaged. Create a new queue after a safe backup? Pending jobs will be replaced. Existing images, accounts, favourites and EPG remain."
msgstr "The artwork job database is damaged. Create a new queue after a safe backup? Pending jobs will be replaced. Existing images, accounts, favourites and EPG remain."

msgctxt "#32903"
msgid "Checking artwork jobs and creating a consistent backup. This may take a moment."
msgstr "Checking artwork jobs and creating a consistent backup. This may take a moment."

msgctxt "#32904"
msgid "Background artwork preloading is paused after recovery. Existing images remain available; visible pages can load missing images. Use the artwork retry action to resume background preloading."
msgstr "Background artwork preloading is paused after recovery. Existing images remain available; visible pages can load missing images. Use the artwork retry action to resume background preloading."

msgctxt "#32910"
msgid "The view could not be opened. Home remains available. Close any open Kodi dialog and try again."
msgstr "The view could not be opened. Home remains available. Close any open Kodi dialog and try again."

